@OrdersApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

### All orders
GET {{OrdersApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### Orders for a customer (case-insensitive)
GET {{OrdersApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/customer/Nino
Accept: application/json

### Statistics for completed orders
GET {{OrdersApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/statistics
Accept: application/json

###
